{"x":1,"y":"0","captures":[[{"rule":0,"flash":[],"flips":[]},{"rule":3,"flash":[],"flips":[]}]],"p1s":2,"p2s":8,"eb":0,"z":"Ymx1ZQ==/62646b213a456d48614f5b4e36386345615b6a583e5954566f4924385b","u":2,"c":"4","dialog":[[],[{"buttons":[{"name":"Thanks!","direction":1}],"content":"<p>The Plus rule requires two equal rank sums at minimum. It's possible to capture three or even four cards with Plus, even four cards with two different sets of equal sums. </p><p>Rules are always cumulative, so Basic, Same, and Plus rules can be applied to a single play. Like the Same rule, Plus also triggers Combo.</p><p>Thanks for listening and good luck. Kupo!</p>"}]],"gameover":[]}
